  "title": "8-Channel SSVEP EEG Dataset with Artifact Trials",
  "description": "An 8-channel wearable EEG dataset of steady-state visual evoked potentials (SSVEP) recorded from 6 participants. Stimulation was delivered at 2 Hz, 4 Hz and 8 Hz. Each participant completed trials while staying still and trials with voluntary head/neck and eye movements, so the recordings include both clean and artifact-contaminated data.",
  "methods_description": "Six participants performed SSVEP tasks with visual stimulation at three frequencies (2, 4, and 8 Hz). For each frequency they completed three trials remaining as static as possible and three trials with voluntary head/neck and eye movements to induce artifacts.",
